@startuml forms-vol03-flow
title Sample flow - ordering a test and returning the result
autonumber

actor "Ordering\nclinician" as DR
participant "Lab / imaging\n(vol 3)" as LIS

DR -> LIS : places the order (referral)
LIS -> LIS : collect specimen, run analysis\n(029 sampling, 034 lab register)
LIS -> DR : result returned, linked to the order\n(040-130 tahlili, or 015-x / 017 / 019 / 020 bayoni)

note over LIS
  Imaging (015 ultrasound, 017 X-ray, 019 CT/MRI)
  produces a report and, with PACS, stored images.
end note
@enduml
